  "body": "Elevate your lifestyle in this stunning 17th floor Sentinel one level lock and leave residence, capturing sweeping panoramic views across Rangitoto, Waitemata Harbour, Auckland's iconic city skyline through to the Waitakere Ranges in the distance.  One of the Sentinels most popular and sought after floor plans, this spacious 98m apartment features two bedrooms, both with ensuite bathrooms and walk in wardrobes, plus a separate guest toilet and laundry. From the moment you step inside, the abundance of natural light and spectacular outlook through floor to ceiling windows create an immediate wow factor. Modern, beautifully presented and in exceptional condition, this is effortless apartment living at its finest.  Indulge in the world class resort style facilities, including a 25m swimming pool, fully equipped gymnasium, sauna, spa and the welcoming service of a friendly concierge team, even when you are away.  Even the everyday conveniences such as a rubbish chute make life that much easier.  Two secure carparks and storage included.  Step outsid and immerse yourself in the buzz of vibrant Takapuna, seven days a week. Everything is on your doorstep, fabulous cafes and restaurants, boutique shopping, supermarkets, schools and the popular Sunday market.  Start your morning with a beach walk, enjoy an ocean swim, spend an afternoon sailing or simply meet friends for coffee or a leisurely lunch.  The choices are endless.  More than just an exceptional apartment, this is an invitation to embrace a lifestyle of freedom, convenience, activity and connection in one of Aucklands most desirable coastal locations.  Did I mention fantastic security? No need to worry when you are away.  Phone Alison Parker Takapuna Apartment Specialist on 021983533 today to view.",
